          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Visit the bonfires within Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest, Westfall, and the Wetlands, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.",
      "title": "Flickering Flames in the Eastern Kingdoms",
